$ CBAR with I1 blank (zero) and rz pin flagged. DOF 6 has no stiffness so it can't be pin flagged.
$ This must be a fatal error with no solution.
SOL 101
CEND
TITLE = 101_bar_zero_i1_pinflag_error
ECHO = NONE
SPC = 1
LOAD = 1
DISPLACEMENT = ALL
SPCFORCES = ALL
STRESS = ALL
ELFORCE = ALL
BEGIN BULK
PARAM,POST,-1
MAT1,1,2.E+11,,0.3,0.,0.,0.0
PBAR,1,1,0.0001,,8.333333333E-10,1.406E-09,,,+P1
+P1,0.005,0.005,-0.005,0.005,-0.005,-0.005,0.005,-0.005
GRID,1,,0.,0.,0.0
GRID,2,,0.5,0.,0.0
GRID,3,,1.,0.,0.0
CBAR,1,1,1,2,0.0,1.0,0.0,,+C1
+C1,6,
CBAR,2,1,2,3,0.0,1.0,0.0
SPC1,1,123456,1
FORCE,1,3,,1.0,1000.0,0.0,10.0
ENDDATA
